    lines = ["# TrackOCD ICLR 2027 — Phase 23 Proposal Source Replacement and Candidate Generation", "", f"**Execution (UTC):** `{decision['execution_time']}`  ", f"**Decision:** `{decision['decision_code']}`  ", "**Gate P2:** **FAIL**", "", "## Executive result", "", "Phase23 corrected the first actionable Phase22 data-path error (a complete DINOv2 NPZ/CSV row-key order mismatch) in an independent in-memory loader, then completed the registered candidate-pool and quality-ranker experiments.  The fixed candidate pool has a diagnostic prefix16 ceiling of **38/76**, but the trained class-agnostic ranker selects reliable candidates for only **21/76**, below the raw DSCT baseline **25/76** and the Gate P2 threshold **38/76**.  Source/target event coverage also falls from 49/40 to 44/36.  Gate P2 therefore fails and the branch stops before correspondence, controller, modern backbone, final training or public evaluation.", "", "## Scope, sealing and provenance", "", "Only public TRAIN-derived rows/GT/category/video metadata and the fixed 76-event pseudo-held manifest were used.  DEV+, Q1, public new-model labels, future frames/tracks, physical IDs and semantic text were not accessed.  Phase15/17/19/19R/20/21/22 evaluators, results and checkpoints were read-only.  This project directory has no git worktree; the exact state is recorded in [`phase23_decision.json`](../../outputs/iclr27_phase23/audit/phase23_decision.json).", "", "## Phase22 first root cause and minimal repair", "", f"The corrected CSV and DINOv2 NPZ contain the same five-field keys but **0/{stage0['rows']} positional matches** (CSV row 0 `{stage0['feature_key_alignment']['before_example']['csv_row0_key']}`, NPZ row 0 `{stage0['feature_key_alignment']['before_example']['npz_row0_key']}`); set overlap is {stage0['feature_key_alignment']['set_overlap_count']} and key-aligned exact matches are {stage0['feature_key_alignment']['aligned_exact_count']}.  All 76 event row sets and folds were affected.  Phase22's key map was not applied when indexing `cls[row_indices]`/`roi[row_indices]`, so its learned 3/76 result is invalid as a representation conclusion.  Phase23 applies a deterministic in-memory permutation (SHA256 `{stage0['feature_key_alignment']['permutation_sha256']}`) and does not modify Phase22 files.", "", "Geometry/chronology itself remains clean: invalid boxes, normalized-coordinate mismatches and stored-IoU mismatches are `0/0/0`.  The two-step aligned smoke and fold-0 targeted regression preserve raw **25/76** and the identity residual preserves the raw ceiling; aligned/legacy prediction counts and hashes are in [`alignment_smoke_targeted_regression.json`](../../outputs/iclr27_phase23/audit/alignment_smoke_targeted_regression.json).", "", "## Stage 0 audit", "", f"Rows: **{stage0['rows']}**; valid GT rows: **{stage0['phase22_label_statistics']['gt_bbox_valid']}**; assigned rows: **{stage0['phase22_label_statistics']['assigned']}**.  Raw row IoU bins and per-event source/target max-IoU bins are retained in [`stage0_refiner_failure_audit.json`](../../outputs/iclr27_phase23/audit/stage0_refiner_failure_audit.json).  The Phase22 residual's first observed failure was moving usable boxes away from identity under mispaired visual features; label statistics showed no GT-positive unassigned rows.  The corrected protocol therefore tests candidate coverage before any new residual model.", "", "## Stage 1 — fixed candidate-pool oracle", "", "The pre-registered pool keeps every raw proposal and adds scale factors `{0.8,1.0,1.25}`, center shifts `{-0.2,0,0.2}` and up to four earlier same-track causal boxes (27 transforms per parent).  No event-specific selection or hard-event deletion occurs.", "", "| prefix | raw ceiling | candidate-pool oracle | source reliable events | target reliable events | category coverage | video coverage |", "|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|"]
    for x in stage1["prefix_summary"]: lines.append(f"| {x['prefix']} | {x['raw_ceiling']}/76 | {x['candidate_pool_ceiling']}/76 | {x['source_reliable_events']} | {x['target_reliable_events']} | {x['category_coverage']} | {x['video_coverage']} |")
    lines += ["", f"At prefix16 the oracle is **{stage1['prefix16']['candidate_pool_ceiling']}/76** (folds **8/12, 5/12, 15/24, 10/28**), exactly meeting the conditional Stage2A authorization.  TRAIN-only IoU .5 candidate recall is **{stage1['train_gt_candidate_recall']['0.5']['candidate_pool_recall']:.4f}** versus raw **{stage1['train_gt_candidate_recall']['0.5']['raw_recall']:.4f}**.  Complete event/prefix records, recall bins and failure keys are [`candidate_event_records.json`](../../outputs/iclr27_phase23/audit/candidate_event_records.json) and [`candidate_pool_recall.json`](../../outputs/iclr27_phase23/audit/candidate_pool_recall.json).", "", "## Stage 2A — quality/objectness ranker", "", "One independent MLP ranker (DINOv2 CLS/ROI parent feature + causal geometry + candidate box/transform metadata) was trained with IoU-soft BCE/SmoothL1 and within-row hard-negative ranking.  Inputs exclude GT, row IoU, category/physical/semantic IDs and future information.  Four video/category-disjoint folds ran 4,000 updates, BF16, batch 256, one worker per GPU0–3, checkpoints every 500.  The first pass with wrong candidate metadata order is explicitly superseded and not used.", "", "| fold | fit candidates | validation candidates | top1 recall | top5 recall | top5 IoU mean | ECE | best step |", "|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|"]
