    lines += ["", "## Complete 76-event index (prefix16)", "", "Every positive event remains in the denominator.  `R/P/Q/G` below are raw, candidate-pool oracle, quality ranker and GT-tight ceiling bits; source/target reliability bits are also shown for the learned condition.", "", "| event | fold | cat | raw R/P/Q/G | pool R/P/Q/G | ranker S/T/C | GT S/T/C |", "|---|---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|"]
